raiha: How'd it go?
# sprite right itsuki chapter_10_serious
itsuki: They got mad and threw us out.
# sprite right nino chapter_10_annoyed
Nino kept slamming her forehead against the table, regretting every action that led to her agreeing to Yotsuba's plan.
