# sprite left isanari chapter_10_boisterous_laugh
isanari: Don't tell him I told you this, he'd probably kill me! He was crying like a baby and he refused to let Fuutarou see him like that. He should be here soon. That doesn't matter, though. Let's party!
# sprite left raiha chapter_10_exasperated
